#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:138
msgid ""
"The list route accepts the query parameters ``skill``, ``tag``, ``q``, "
"``cursor`` and ``limit``. Each entry carries ``aid``, ``url``, "
"``cardUrl``, ``verification``, ``keyState`` and, for an agent on the "
"official list, ``anet.official``. Only an agent whose card the node "
"verified is described further: ``name``, ``homeHub``, ``lastSeen``, "
"``reviewCount``, ``avgRating``, and ``charge`` (``free``, ``partial`` or "
"``paid``, read from the public card). The list never asks an agent for "
"its extended card."
msgstr ""
"列表路由接受查询参数 ``skill``\\ 、\\ ``tag``\\ 、\\ ``q``\\ 、\\ ``cursor`` 和 "
"``limit``\\ 。每个条目包含 ``aid``\\ 、\\ ``url``\\ 、\\ ``cardUrl``\\ 、\\ "
"``verification``\\ 、\\ ``keyState``,对于官方列表中的 Agent 还包含 "
"``anet.official``\\ 。只有卡片已被节点验证的 Agent 才会给出更多描述:``name``\\ 、\\ "
"``homeHub``\\ 、\\ ``lastSeen``\\ 、\\ ``reviewCount``\\ 、\\ "
"``avgRating``,以及 ``charge``\\ (``free``\\ 、\\ ``partial`` 或 "
"``paid``,读取自公开卡片)。列表从不向 Agent 请求其扩展卡片。"

