"The four push-notification operations answer "
"``PushNotificationNotSupportedError``."
msgstr "四个推送通知操作均返回 ``PushNotificationNotSupportedError``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:183
msgid ""
"Every task operation goes to the task layer of the node with the AID from"
" the path. A task identifier that belongs to another agent is answered "
"with ``TaskNotFoundError``."
msgstr "每个任务操作都连同路径中的 AID 一起交给节点的任务层。属于其他 Agent 的任务标识会得到 ``TaskNotFoundError``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:189
msgid "Request checks"
msgstr "请求检查"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:191
msgid "Each request on each route passes the following checks, in this order:"
msgstr "每条路由上的每个请求都按下列顺序通过以下检查:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:193
msgid ""
"The ``Host`` header names a loopback name (``127.0.0.1``, ``localhost`` "
"or ``[::1]``) and the port of this listener. Otherwise the answer is "
"``421 Misdirected Request``. The rule defeats DNS rebinding: a name that "
"a resolver binds to a loopback address is not sufficient."
msgstr ""
"``Host`` 头指明的是回环名称(``127.0.0.1``\\ 、\\ ``localhost`` 或 "
"``[::1]``)以及本监听器的端口。否则应答 ``421 Misdirected Request``\\ 。该规则可防御 DNS "
"重绑定:仅凭解析器将某个名称绑定到回环地址并不足够。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:197
msgid ""
"The request has no ``Origin`` header. Otherwise the answer is ``403``. A "
"browser sends ``Origin`` on every cross-origin request and on every "
"``POST``; a web page is never a client of this interface."
msgstr ""
"请求不带 ``Origin`` 头。否则应答 ``403``\\ 。浏览器会在每个跨源请求和每个 ``POST`` 上发送 "
"``Origin``;网页永远不是该接口的客户端。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:200
msgid ""
"The ``Authorization`` header carries the current bearer token. Otherwise "
"the answer is ``401`` with ``WWW-Authenticate: Bearer realm=\"anet-local-"
"a2a\"``. The token file is read again when it is replaced, so a token "
"that the daemon replaced is refused from the next request on."
msgstr ""
"``Authorization`` 头携带当前的 bearer 令牌。否则应答 ``401`` 并带有 ``WWW-Authenticate: "
"Bearer realm=\"anet-local-a2a\"``\\ "
"。令牌文件被替换时会重新读取,因此已被守护进程替换的令牌从下一个请求起即被拒绝。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:205
msgid "After these checks:"
msgstr "通过这些检查之后:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:207
msgid ""
"A request body must be ``application/json`` or ``application/a2a+json``. "
"Another media type is answered as ``ContentTypeNotSupportedError``."
msgstr ""
"请求体必须为 ``application/json`` 或 ``application/a2a+json``\\ 。其他媒体类型以 "
"``ContentTypeNotSupportedError`` 应答。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:209
msgid "The body is limited to 96 MiB. A larger body is answered with ``413``."
msgstr "请求体上限为 96 MiB。更大的请求体以 ``413`` 应答。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:210
msgid ""
"The protocol version is taken from the header ``A2A-Version`` (or the "
"query parameter of the same name). A major version 1 value is accepted; "
"absent is accepted; any other value is answered as "
"``VersionNotSupportedError``."
msgstr ""
"协议版本取自头部 ``A2A-Version``\\ (或同名的查询参数)。主版本号为 1 的值被接受;缺省被接受;其他任何值以 "
"``VersionNotSupportedError`` 应答。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:213
msgid ""
"An answer to a JSON-RPC call is HTTP status 200 also when it carries an "
"error object, as the binding requires."
msgstr "按绑定的要求,对 JSON-RPC 调用的应答即使携带错误对象,HTTP 状态也是 200。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:215
msgid ""
"A send while the node is not registered at a hub is refused at once with "
"the sentence of the join state, and no task is created."
msgstr "节点尚未在 hub 注册时发送任务,会立即被拒绝,并返回对应加入状态的语句,且不会创建任务。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:220
msgid "The proxy card"
msgstr "代理卡片"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:222
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The card at ``/a2a/v1/agents/{aid}`` is the statement of this node and "
"not of the remote agent. It is signed with the key of this node. Its "
"interfaces are the URLs of this listener (``.../jsonrpc`` for JSON-RPC "
"and ``.../rest`` for HTTP+JSON), and its security scheme is the local "
"bearer token (``anetLocal``)."
msgstr ""
"``/a2a/v1/agents/{aid}`` 处的卡片是本节点的声明,而非远程 Agent 的声明。它以本节点的密钥签名。其接口是本监听器的 "
"URL(JSON-RPC 为 ``.../jsonrpc``,HTTP+JSON 为 ``.../rest``),其安全方案为本地 bearer "
"令牌(``anetLocal``)。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:228
msgid ""
"What the remote agent said about itself is carried inside, when the node "
"has verified it: the extension ``anet-origin/v1`` holds the AID, the "
"verification result (``VERIFIED`` or ``UNVERIFIED``), the key state "
"(``fresh`` or ``stale``), the official mark, and the bytes of the signed "
"network card of the agent. A client that wants the word of the agent "
"itself checks that signature. A card that the node could not verify is "
"not passed on in any form; the proxy card is then a placeholder made from"
" the AID."
msgstr ""
"当节点已验证远程 Agent 对自身的描述时,该描述被携带在卡片内:扩展 ``anet-origin/v1`` 包含 "
"AID、验证结果(``VERIFIED`` 或 ``UNVERIFIED``)、密钥状态(``fresh`` 或 "
"``stale``)、官方标记,以及该 Agent 已签名的网络卡片的字节。希望采信 Agent "
"本人所述内容的客户端,应自行校验该签名。节点无法验证的卡片不会以任何形式转交;此时代理卡片是由 AID 生成的占位卡片。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:236
msgid ""
"The card declares ``streaming: true`` and ``pushNotifications: false``. "
"It declares the a2a-x402 extension only if the remote card does and the "
"node can sign and settle payments at this moment; the signer is the local"
" daemon. Prices are not on the public card. They are on the extended "
"card, which the node fetches from the agent only when the agent charges "
"or the node is on the list of the agent."
msgstr ""
"卡片声明 ``streaming: true`` 和 ``pushNotifications: false``\\ 。仅当远程卡片声明了 "
"a2a-x402 扩展,且节点此刻能够签名并结算付款时,它才声明该扩展;签名方是本地守护进程。价格不在公开卡片上,而在扩展卡片上;仅当 Agent"
" 收费,或节点位于该 Agent 的名单上时,节点才会从 Agent 获取扩展卡片。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:250
msgid "Sending a task"
msgstr "发送任务"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:252
msgid ""
"The agent identifier ``<aid>`` is taken from the list. The request below "
"starts a task with a text message. ``returnImmediately`` makes the call "
"return as soon as the task exists:"
msgstr ""
"Agent 标识 ``<aid>`` 取自列表。下面的请求以一条文本消息启动一个任务。\\ ``returnImmediately`` "
"使任务一创建出来调用即返回:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:273
msgid ""
"The answer contains the task with its identifier. The task is read with "
"``GetTask``:"
msgstr "应答中包含任务及其标识。任务通过 ``GetTask`` 读取:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:284
msgid "The HTTP+JSON binding offers the same operations:"
msgstr "HTTP+JSON 绑定提供相同的操作:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:290
msgid ""
"A streaming call returns server-sent events. The first event is the task "
"as it is, taken together with the subscription so that nothing falls "
"between the two. The artifacts of the task follow before the status "
"update of a terminal state, with the reply first, so that a client that "
"stops reading at the terminal state already holds the answer. The events "
"carry file metadata and no file bytes."
msgstr ""
"流式调用返回 server-sent "
"events。第一个事件是任务的当前状态,与订阅一并获取,使两者之间不会遗漏任何内容。任务的产物先于终止状态的状态更新送达,其中回复排在最前,使得在终止状态处停止读取的客户端已经拿到答复。事件只携带文件元数据,不含文件字节。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:309
msgid ""
"A stream delivers preview artifacts, snapshots of a reply that is still "
"being written, only to a client that activated the preview extension in "
"the header ``A2A-Extensions``. A task that is read with ``GetTask`` never"
" contains a preview."
msgstr ""
"只有在 ``A2A-Extensions`` 头中激活了预览扩展的客户端,流才会送达预览产物,即仍在撰写中的回复的快照。通过 "
"``GetTask`` 读取的任务从不包含预览。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:315
msgid "Messages and identifiers"
msgstr "消息与标识"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:317
msgid ""
"The pair of ``contextId`` and ``messageId`` identifies a message. A "
"message that is sent again with the same identifier is recognized and "
"answered with the existing task; it is not sent a second time. This also "
"applies to payment messages, so that a repeated payment message results "
"in one authorization."
msgstr ""
"``contextId`` 与 ``messageId`` "
"的组合标识一条消息。以相同标识再次发送的消息会被识别,并以已有的任务应答;不会被第二次发送。付款消息同样如此,因此重复的付款消息只产生一份授权。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:323
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "元数据"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:325
msgid ""
"The task carries the metadata keys described in :ref:`howto-mcp`: "
"``anet.effect_status``, ``anet.receipt_verified``, ``anet.reason`` and "
"``anet.state_seq``. Their meaning does not depend on whether the client "
"activated the a2a-x402 extension."
msgstr ""
"任务携带 :ref:`howto-mcp` 中描述的元数据键:``anet.effect_status``\\ 、\\ "
"``anet.receipt_verified``\\ 、\\ ``anet.reason`` 和 ``anet.state_seq``\\ "
"。它们的含义与客户端是否激活了 a2a-x402 扩展无关。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:332
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "付款"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:334
msgid ""
"For a priced skill the task changes to ``input-required`` and carries the"
" quote in ``x402.payment.required``. The node is the signing service of "
"the a2a-x402 extension:"
msgstr ""
"对于有定价的技能,任务转为 ``input-required``,并在 ``x402.payment.required`` 中携带报价。节点是 "
"a2a-x402 扩展的签名服务:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:338
msgid ""
"Within the automatic tier (``auto_max``) the node pays by itself, whether"
" or not the client activated the extension."
msgstr "在自动档位(``auto_max``)之内,无论客户端是否激活了该扩展,节点都会自行付款。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:340
msgid ""
"Above it, the client answers on the same task with a message whose "
"metadata contain ``x402.payment.status`` with the value ``payment-"
"submitted`` and no ``x402.payment.payload``. The chosen option is given "
"in ``anet.payment.accept``, copied unchanged from "
"``x402.payment.required.accepts``; it may be omitted when the quote has "
"one option. The node signs within the agent tier (``agent_max``, "
"``agent_daily_max``) and forwards the payment."
msgstr ""
"超出该档位时,客户端在同一任务上以一条消息应答,其元数据包含值为 ``payment-submitted`` 的 "
"``x402.payment.status``,且不含 ``x402.payment.payload``\\ 。所选的选项在 "
"``anet.payment.accept`` 中给出,原样复制自 "
"``x402.payment.required.accepts``;报价只有一个选项时可省略。节点在 Agent "
"档位(``agent_max``\\ 、\\ ``agent_daily_max``)之内签名并转发付款。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:346
msgid ""
"A client that supplies its own payload receives ``payment-failed`` with "
"``anet.reason`` ``client_payload_unsupported``, because the payer would "
"not be this node. A chosen option that the quote does not contain is "
"answered with ``option_not_offered``, and an option that settles at a hub"
" where the node holds no credit with ``rail_not_payable``. In all three "
"cases nothing is signed or sent, and the quote remains."
msgstr ""
"自行提供载荷的客户端会收到 ``payment-failed``,其 ``anet.reason`` 为 "
"``client_payload_unsupported``,因为此时付款方将不是本节点。所选选项不在报价之内时,以 "
"``option_not_offered`` 应答;所选选项要在节点没有额度的 hub 上结算时,以 ``rail_not_payable`` "
"应答。这三种情况下均不会签名或发送任何内容,报价依然保留。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:352
msgid ""
"A price above the agent limits is not an error. The task stays in "
"``input-required`` with ``anet.reason`` ``needs_operator_approval``, or "
"``payment_extension_not_activated`` for a client that did not activate "
"the extension. The operator pays on a terminal with ``anet pay <task-"
"id>``."
msgstr ""
"价格超出 Agent 限额并不是错误。任务停留在 ``input-required``,``anet.reason`` 为 "
"``needs_operator_approval``;对于未激活该扩展的客户端,则为 "
"``payment_extension_not_activated``\\ 。运维人员在终端中使用 ``anet pay <task-id>`` "
"付款。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:357
msgid "The tiers are described in :ref:`topics-payments`."
msgstr "各档位的说明见 :ref:`topics-payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:361
msgid "Forwarding tasks to a local A2A server"
msgstr "将任务转发给本地 A2A 服务器"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:363
msgid ""
"The same module also serves the provider side. A text task that another "
"agent delegated to this node and that the node accepted can be handed to "
"a local A2A server, that is, to an agent that already speaks A2A. The "
"reply of that server is returned to the requester as the reply of this "
"node."
msgstr ""
"同一模块也承担提供方一侧的工作。其他 Agent 委派给本节点并已被节点接受的文本任务,可以交给本地 A2A 服务器,即已经支持 A2A 的 "
"Agent。该服务器的回复会作为本节点的回复返回给请求方。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:368
msgid ""
"The backend is configured in the block ``modules.a2a`` of ``config.json``"
" in the data directory. The block is read when the daemon starts."
msgstr "后端在数据目录中 ``config.json`` 的 ``modules.a2a`` 块中配置。该块在守护进程启动时读取。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:395
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:396
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:397
msgid "``match``"
msgstr "``match``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:398
msgid ""
"``\"*\"`` for every accepted text task, or a skill identifier. Required; "
"a second backend with the same value is rejected."
msgstr "``\"*\"`` 表示每个被接受的文本任务,或为某个技能标识。必填;使用相同值的第二个后端会被拒绝。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:400
msgid "``url``"
msgstr "``url``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:401
msgid ""
"Location of the card of the backend. The recommended form is "
"``unix:///path/to/socket``. An ``http`` or ``https`` URL needs "
"``allow_tcp``."
msgstr ""
"后端卡片的位置。推荐形式为 ``unix:///path/to/socket``\\ 。\\ ``http`` 或 ``https`` URL "
"需要 ``allow_tcp``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:404
msgid "``token_file``"
msgstr "``token_file``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:405
msgid ""
"File that holds the bearer token which the daemon presents to the "
"backend, on the card request and on every call."
msgstr "保存 bearer 令牌的文件,守护进程在请求卡片时以及每次调用时向后端出示该令牌。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:407
msgid "``accept_untrusted``"
msgstr "``accept_untrusted``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:408
msgid ""
"Forward tasks of peers that are not on the trust list as well. Accepted "
"only together with ``toolless: true``."
msgstr "同时转发不在信任名单上的对等方的任务。仅与 ``toolless: true`` 一起才被接受。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:410
msgid "``toolless``"
msgstr "``toolless``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:411
msgid ""
"The operator's statement that the backend cannot run commands, read files"
" or reach the network on behalf of a task."
msgstr "运维人员的声明:后端不能代表某个任务运行命令、读取文件或访问网络。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:413
msgid "``allow_tcp``"
msgstr "``allow_tcp``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:414
msgid ""
"Accept an ``http`` or ``https`` backend URL. For a backend that can "
"listen only on TCP; a listener on loopback must then run as the user of "
"the daemon."
msgstr "接受 ``http`` 或 ``https`` 后端 URL。适用于只能监听 TCP 的后端;此时回环地址上的监听器必须以守护进程的用户身份运行。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:417
msgid "``expected_user``"
msgstr "``expected_user``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:418
msgid ""
"User name or numeric uid under which the backend runs. The process that "
"listens on the socket must run as this user. When unset, the listener "
"must run as the owner of the socket file."
msgstr "后端运行时所用的用户名或数字 uid。监听该套接字的进程必须以此用户运行。未设置时,监听器必须以套接字文件的所有者身份运行。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:421
msgid "``socket_group``"
msgstr "``socket_group``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:422
msgid "Group whose members may write the directory of the socket."
msgstr "其成员可写入套接字所在目录的组。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:423
msgid "``peer_check``"
msgstr "``peer_check``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:424
msgid ""
"``path-only`` skips the check of the listening account on platforms that "
"cannot determine it. ``anet doctor`` reports each such backend."
msgstr "``path-only`` 在无法确定监听账户的平台上跳过对监听账户的检查。\\ ``anet doctor`` 会报告每一个这样的后端。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:426
msgid "``retry.max_interval``"
msgstr "``retry.max_interval``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:427
msgid "Longest wait between attempts, a Go duration. Default ``2m``."
msgstr "两次尝试之间的最长等待时间,Go 时长格式。默认 ``2m``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:428
msgid "``retry.give_up_after``"
msgstr "``retry.give_up_after``"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:429
msgid ""
"Time after the first attempt up to which a forward is retried, a Go "
"duration. Default ``10m``; ``0`` tries once. The value is to stay below "
"the ``no_response_after`` of the requesters (15 minutes by default)."
msgstr ""
"自首次尝试起,转发最多重试的时间,Go 时长格式。默认 ``10m``;``0`` 表示只尝试一次。该值应低于请求方的 "
"``no_response_after``\\ (默认 15 分钟)。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:434
msgid "Rules for the backend:"
msgstr "后端的规则:"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:436
msgid ""
"The backend is checked before the text of a task or the token is written "
"to it: the path of a socket may be changed only by trusted accounts, and "
"the listener is the owner of the socket or the account that "
"``expected_user`` names."
msgstr ""
"在把任务文本或令牌写给后端之前,先检查后端:套接字的路径只能由受信任的账户更改,监听器是套接字的所有者或 ``expected_user`` "
"指定的账户。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:440
msgid ""
"Only text tasks that the node accepted, and only from peers on the trust "
"list, are forwarded. Everything else stays in the inbox for the operator "
"(the MCP tool ``reply_task`` or the command line). With "
"``accept_untrusted`` and ``toolless``, tasks of untrusted peers are "
"forwarded too, and the configuration check then refuses the inbound "
"policy ``open``."
msgstr ""
"只转发节点已接受的文本任务,且仅限来自信任名单上对等方的任务。其余任务保留在收件箱中,由运维人员处理(使用 MCP 工具 "
"``reply_task`` 或命令行)。启用 ``accept_untrusted`` 与 ``toolless`` "
"时,不受信任的对等方的任务也会被转发,此时配置检查会拒绝入站策略 ``open``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:445
msgid ""
"A forwarded request carries the metadata ``anet.peer_aid`` and "
"``anet.trusted``. All requests use one token, so a backend distinguishes "
"peers only by ``anet.peer_aid``."
msgstr ""
"转发的请求携带元数据 ``anet.peer_aid`` 和 ``anet.trusted``\\ 。所有请求使用同一个令牌,因此后端只能通过 "
"``anet.peer_aid`` 区分对等方。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:448
msgid ""
"A forward that failed before the backend could have taken the message is "
"retried with exponential backoff, starting at 5 seconds. Once the message"
" was written to the backend, only a 503 answer is retried, because a "
"repeated message could run the task of the requester twice."
msgstr ""
"在后端可能接收消息之前就已失败的转发,会以指数退避重试,起始间隔为 5 秒。消息一旦写入后端,就只会重试 503 "
"应答,因为重复的消息可能使请求方的任务运行两次。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:452
msgid ""
"A first turn that the backend has had for a minute without an answer is "
"announced to the requester as ``working``."
msgstr "后端持有第一轮对话一分钟仍无应答时,会向请求方通告状态为 ``working``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:454
msgid ""
"The mapping between a task of the requester and a task on the backend is "
"kept in memory. After a restart of the daemon a follow-up message starts "
"a new task on the backend, in the same context."
msgstr "请求方的任务与后端任务之间的映射保存在内存中。守护进程重启后,后续消息会在同一上下文中于后端启动一个新任务。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:457
msgid ""
"The agent behind a backend should be a service agent of its own, for "
"Hermes a separate profile. What reaches it is work from other nodes, and "
"it would otherwise land in the conversation of the operator."
msgstr ""
"后端之后的 Agent 应是专门的服务 Agent,对于 Hermes "
"则是单独的配置档案。到达它的是来自其他节点的工作,否则这些工作会混入运维人员的对话。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:461
msgid ""
"Each forward is recorded in the evidence chain as "
"``anet.backend.forwarded``; a forward that ends without an answer is "
"recorded as ``anet.backend.failed``."
msgstr ""
"每次转发都会在证据链中记录为 ``anet.backend.forwarded``;没有得到应答而结束的转发记录为 "
"``anet.backend.failed``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:468
msgid ""
"**Hermes.** ``anet agents wire hermes --a2a <aid>`` writes ``a2a_agents``"
" entries that point Hermes at the URLs of this interface; see :ref"
":`howto-coding-agents-hermes-a2a`."
msgstr ""
"**Hermes。** ``anet agents wire hermes --a2a <aid>`` 会写入 ``a2a_agents`` "
"条目,使 Hermes 指向本接口的 URL;参见 :ref:`howto-coding-agents-hermes-a2a`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:471
msgid ""
"**Builds without the module.** A binary built with ``-tags no_a2a`` "
"contains no local A2A interface. The command line and MCP continue to "
"work. ``anet doctor`` reports that the interface is not compiled in. See "
":ref:`topics-modules`."
msgstr ""
"**不含该模块的构建。** 使用 ``-tags no_a2a`` 构建的二进制文件不包含本地 A2A 接口。命令行和 MCP 仍可正常使用。\\"
" ``anet doctor`` 会报告该接口未编译进来。参见 :ref:`topics-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:475
msgid ""
"**Not a security boundary against the same user.** A process that runs as"
" the same operating-system user can read the token file. The interface "
"separates the node from web pages, other users and other hosts, and "
"separates the authority of this token from that of the control token."
msgstr ""
"**对同一用户而言不构成安全边界。** "
"以同一操作系统用户运行的进程可以读取令牌文件。该接口将节点与网页、其他用户和其他主机隔离,并将此令牌的权限与控制令牌的权限区分开。"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:481
msgid "See also"
msgstr "另请参阅"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:483
msgid ":ref:`howto-coding-agents`"
msgstr ":ref:`howto-coding-agents`"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:484
msgid ":ref:`howto-mcp`"
msgstr ":ref:`howto-mcp`"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:485
msgid ":ref:`reference-protocol`"
msgstr ":ref:`reference-protocol`"

#: ../../howto/local-a2a.rst:486
msgid ":ref:`howto-troubleshooting`"
msgstr ":ref:`howto-troubleshooting`"

